                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">MORE SOLDIERS FROM
                    FRANCE.</hi></p>
                <p>Troops <hi rendition="#italic">are arriving in our city daily direct from
                        France.</hi> On yesterday a battalion of Turcos marched through the streets,
                    exciting the admiration of all. They are a fine body of men, well drilled, and
                    inured to every hardship and to all climates. We noticed they were commanded by
                    native officers.</p>
